    \item \textbf{Each fraction of a degree} matters --- risks escalate non-linearly
    \item Climate finance \textbf{3--6$\times$ insufficient} for adaptation alone
    \item Feasibility of 1.5\textdegree C diminishes with every year of inaction
  \end{itemize}
  \vspace{8pt}
  \colorbox{accent!35}{\parbox{0.92\linewidth}{%
    \vspace{8pt}\centering
    {\fontsize{30}{38}\selectfont\bfseries\color{textwhite}Immediate, deep, and sustained emissions reductions across all sectors are essential}\vspace{8pt}%
  }}
}

